  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'pastel-sleeping-beauty-turquoise-cuff-navajo-r-joe-stamped-sterling-silver-brace', '4607331971', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4607331971/pastel-sleeping-beauty-turquoise-cuff?click_key=Euvi7hhn0ZWXj9DR2e8OLySZkf1f%3ALTaee10b9271612669db9d21c485936902470b595e&click_sum=08a555ee&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-960713-10-4&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&sts=1',
   'Pastel Sleeping Beauty Turquoise Cuff | Navajo R Joe Stamped Sterling Silver Bracelet', 'A beautiful vintage Navajo silver cuff handcrafted by silversmith R. Joe in solid sterling silver with intricate floral stamped details. This authentic Native American statement bracelet features three pastel Sleeping Beauty turquoise stones set across a heavy stamped split shank cuff, offering a highly sought-after addition to any Southwest turquoise jewelry collection. THE DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION The focal point of this cuff is a trio of matrix-free Sleeping Beauty turquoise stones. The center cabochon showcases a pure sky-blue hue, flanked by two side stones with a subtle, natural green-blue tint that highlights their un-dyed authenticity. Each stone is secured in a traditional sawtooth bezel, framed by sterling rope wire, and separated by silver drop beads. The stones rest on a triple-split shank featuring a central twisted rope wire bordered by two heavy-gauge bands with deep, geometric edge-stamping. The artisan finished the shoulders with intricate hand-stamped floral silver buttons. THE DETAILS • Artisan: R. Joe (Navajo) • Stones: Natural Sleeping Beauty turquoise (Center: 0.68" x 0.46", Sides: 0.59" x 0.46") • Metal: Solid .925 sterling silver • Cuff Width: 0.95 inches at the center face • Band Taper: Tapers to 0.38 inches at the terminals • Cuff Size: 6.5-inch interior circumference (includes a 1.0-inch wrist gap) • Total Weight: 39.25 grams • Hallmarks: Double-signed "R. Joe" and "STERLING" on both interior ends CONDITION Excellent vintage estate condition. The turquoise stones are perfectly smooth, secure, and matrix-free with no chips or cracks. The 39.25-gram sterling silver cuff is structurally sound with no bending, retaining a beautiful polished finish and natural age patina deep within the stamped accents. Ready to wear. STYLING AND GIFT IDEAS With its heavy edge-stamping and pastel stones, this cuff offers a slightly softer color palette while maintaining substantial silver weight. It is an exceptional standalone piece or a beautiful addition to a', 'turquoise-jewelry',
