  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-navajo-silver-necklace-with-natural-coral-long-chain-with-6-dangles-nati', '4451449583', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4451449583/vintage-navajo-silver-necklace-with?click_key=Euvi7hhn0ZWXj9DR2e8OLySZkf1f%3ALT93c1507326866af283751c4b70553d23ee62ddc3&click_sum=a8f2488f&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-960713-10-3&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1',
   'Vintage Navajo Silver Necklace with Natural Coral | Long Chain with 6 Dangles | Native American Jewelry', 'Stunning vintage Navajo necklace, crafted in silver and adorned with natural coral stones set in fixed dangles along the chain. This bold and authentic piece reflects traditional Native American craftsmanship and timeless Southwestern style. The necklace features 6 dangles, each set with 3 natural coral stones, while the bottom dangle includes 5 corals, for a total of 20 natural coral stones. Each dangle setting measures approximately 1.0 x 1.4 inches, creating a striking yet well-balanced design. Item details: • Style: Vintage Navajo / Native American • Material: Silver with natural coral • Total weight: 75.4 grams • Chain length: 26 inches • Number of dangles: 6 • Total coral stones: 20 • Each dangle size: 1.0 x 1.4 inches A unique and eye-catching statement necklace, perfect for collectors or anyone looking to add an authentic vintage Native American piece to their jewelry collection.', 'statement-pieces',
