  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'sterling-silver-navajo-pearl-necklace-3mm-beads-layering-jewelry-for-casual-form', '1839217532', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1839217532/sterling-silver-navajo-pearl-necklace?click_key=Euvi7hhn0ZWXj9DR2e8OLySZkf1f%3ALT0e90b6f4679bf18c20093d04ebe82f320e183bff&click_sum=d5b651e7&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-960713-10-2&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&sts=1',
   'Sterling Silver Navajo Pearl Necklace | 3mm Beads, Layering Jewelry for Casual & Formal Occasions', 'This necklace is handcrafted with small 3mm sterling silver Navajo pearl-style beads, finished with a light oxidized detail that gives each bead depth, contrast, and classic Southwestern character. The clean, simple design makes this necklace easy to wear alone or layer with other favorites. Its refined size gives it a subtle look while still offering the timeless appeal of sterling silver Southwestern jewelry. Perfect for everyday wear, formal styling, or gifting. Details: Bead Size: 3mm sterling silver Navajo pearl-style beads Material: Sterling silver with oxidized finish Design: Simple single-strand beaded necklace with classic Southwestern style Styling: Perfect for layering or wearing alone Finish: Lightly oxidized silver for added depth and character Packaging: Arrives ready for gift-giving Lead Time: Ships within 3 business days Shipping: Standard Shipping to U.S. Addresses: USPS First-Class Mail, usually 2–4 business days Standard Shipping to International Addresses: USPS First-Class International Mail, usually 10–21 business days Origin & Metaphysical Properties: Sterling Silver: Sterling silver has long been valued for its bright shine, strength, and timeless beauty. In Southwestern jewelry, oxidized silver beads are often used to create depth, contrast, and a classic handmade look. Navajo Pearl-Style Beads: Navajo pearl-style beads are inspired by traditional Southwestern silver beadwork. Their lightly oxidized finish gives them a distinctive aged appearance, making them a versatile choice for both simple and layered jewelry designs. This necklace is a clean, timeless sterling silver piece that brings subtle Southwestern style to any jewelry collection.', 'statement-pieces',
