  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-pearl-handmade-6-8mm-bracelet-german-silver-beads', '4319689499', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4319689499/navajo-pearl-handmade-6-8mm-bracelet?click_key=8b388072-9439-4544-97fd-88b76a06451e%3ALT2e10136f0bcb6c763147b2e74d2362036c450fae&click_sum=e139df87&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-69490-9-46&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=8b388072-9439-4544-97fd-88b76a06451e%253ALT2e10136f0bcb6c763147b2e74d2362036c450fae',
   'Navajo Pearl Handmade 6 & 8mm Bracelet ~ German Silver beads!', 'MADE TO ORDER! Proudly handmade in Colorado and New Mexico! Please allow us 2-6 business days to handmake your order before it ships. *Need it in a rush? Message us! This beautiful Navajo Pearl bracelet is made from 6 and 8mm beads. CHOOSE YOUR LENGTH! Select your length from the drop-down menu. Finished with lobster clasp and links of chain for a customizable fit! *Please note that the 6” size is very petite! We recommend measuring your wrist with a string, ribbon, or fabric tape measure before ordering. DESIGNS by Jona Bonecutter HANDMADE by Navajo Artists ~ Michael Joe Thomas, Jr. ~ Linda Thomas ~ Kayla John OUR NAVAJO PEARLS We hand make this jewelry line with beads of German silver, a specialty white bronze alloy containing a blend of metals that boasts excellent tarnish resistance and durability.. Our Navajo artists antique & hand polish them creating perfect Navajo pearls. You can see the beauty and handwork- no two pearls are exactly alike! Although not sterling silver, German silver has the same lifelong quality, look, and weight of sterling silver at a fraction of the price! German silver is a durable, beautiful metal and contains trace amounts of nickel. GERMAN SILVER CARE Avoid chemicals, water, and keep as moisture-free as possible. (Don’t wear your pearls in the shower, pool, hot tub, or bath y’all!) Do not use silver polish. REFUNDS, RETURNS, & REPAIRS We stand by the quality of our jewelry and protect our customers with easy returns. You can return any purchase from us up to 90 days and receive a refund or repair, no restocking fee. Return shipping to us is paid by customer. *Extreme wear, bead loss, or chemical/water damage could void this policy or incur minor cost for repair/replacement. Contact us with questions! FREE GROUND SHIPPING in the US. Arrives in one of our signature gift boxes! *FAVORITE OUR SHOP for a heads up on sales & new items! *FOLLOW US on Instagram, Facebook, & TikTok @NativeSilverTrading Thanks for supporting our woman-owned, h', 'turquoise-jewelry',
