  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'silver-bloom-navajo-pearl-strand-6-mm-sterling-silver-beaded-necklace-or-bracele', '1469549350', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1469549350/6-mm-navajo-pearls-bracelet-or-necklace?click_key=EuBx0mClPiSdZ1De4o4rPsxL_G69%3ALT74395bdb4a852096498d4ff176d600b2aaecbccf&click_sum=d718ff48&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-69489-9-11&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1',
   'Silver Bloom Navajo Pearl Strand, 6 MM Sterling Silver Beaded Necklace or Bracelet, Handmade Silver Strand, Western Layering Jewelry', 'Part of the Silver Bloom Collection One of our most-loved designs for everyday wear. Meet the jewelry piece everyone is completely obsessed with — this 6mm Navajo‑style pearl necklace/bracelet is bold, effortlessly cool, and literally goes with EVERYTHING. Whether you wear it as a necklace or wrap it as a bracelet, it instantly gives your outfit that put‑together, stylish, “I didn’t even try” vibe. ✨ Why It’s a Must‑Have Smooth 6mm Navajo‑style silver beads with that perfect matte‑shine Lightweight and comfy — wear it all day, every day Works as both a necklace or a bracelet, depending on the length Looks amazing alone or layered with chains, charms, and other beads A top seller for a reason: it’s classic, cool, and never goes out of style 💫 The Vibe Think western‑chic meets modern minimalist. It’s sleek, edgy, a little boho, a little bold — the perfect piece for anyone who wants jewelry that stands out without trying too hard. If you would like an extender added to the necklace please select that in the options.', 'statement-pieces',
