  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'navajo-pearl-handmade-cross-pendant-necklace-german-silver-beads-simple-yet-powe', '4318664418', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4318664418/navajo-pearl-handmade-cross-pendant?click_key=8b388072-9439-4544-97fd-88b76a06451e%3ALTe5092549282ed3b9e9c157d2478e41ec1eac6df6&click_sum=c8800558&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-69490-9-13&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=8b388072-9439-4544-97fd-88b76a06451e%253ALTe5092549282ed3b9e9c157d2478e41ec1eac6df6',
   'Navajo Pearl Handmade Cross Pendant Necklace ~ German Silver beads ~ Simple yet powerful!', 'MADE TO ORDER! Proudly handmade in Colorado and New Mexico! Please allow us 2-6 business days to handmake your order before it ships. *Need it in a rush? Contact us! Stunning Western Navajo Pearl & Turquoise Necklace. Navajo Pearls are 6 and 10mm. Pumpkin bead size 10mm, TQ is 8mm. Cross ~ White Bronze Cast in Sterling Silver. CHOOSE YOUR LENGTH! Select your length from the drop-down menu. Choose from a stunning choker, to a traditional look, or an extra-long strand and wrap it around to create multiple looks! Finished with lobster clasp and links of chain for a customizable fit! DESIGNS by Jona Bonecutter HANDMADE by Navajo Artists ~ Michael Joe Thomas, Jr. ~ Linda Thomas ~ Kayla John GERMAN SILVER NAVAJO PEARLS We hand make this jewelry line with beads of German silver, a specialty white bronze alloy containing a blend of metals that boasts excellent tarnish resistance and durability. Our Navajo artists antique & hand polish them to create perfect Navajo pearls. You can see the beauty and handwork- no two desert pearls are exactly alike! See our About German Silver Page to learn more. GERMAN SILVER CARE Avoid chemicals, water, and keep as moisture-free as possible. Check out our Navajo Pearl Care Page for more info and polishing tips. REFUNDS, RETURNS, & REPAIRS We stand by the quality of our jewelry and protect our customers with easy returns. You can return any purchase from us up to 90 days and receive a refund or repair, no restocking fee. Return shipping to us is paid by customer. *Extreme wear, bead loss, or chemical/water damage could void this policy or incur minor cost for repair/replacement. Contact us with questions! FREE GROUND SHIPPING in the US. Arrives in one of our signature gift boxes! *FAVORITE OUR SHOP for a heads up on sales & new items! *FOLLOW US on Instagram, Facebook, & TikTok @NativeSilverTrading Thanks for supporting our woman-owned, handmade in USA, small business! Happy shopping!', 'statement-pieces',
